  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Use log4j (via commons-logging or directly) instead of",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "what we have now. It's more flexible and makes",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "integration tasks easier. Use an XML appender.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-16 10:06",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Do better logging via log4j and messaging to support",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "performance analysis",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-03-24 16:38",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "For any new services, implement logging using log4j.  ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eventually, refactor the core repository service to use ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "log4j.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-02-02 11:08",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "also do a better job of log messages.  what events do we ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "want to log?  What is a meaninful message in the log for the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "event?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
